  "gh:content": {
    "en": "—A short monologue. Childhood under a father’s command. A silent mother. He grew up in a world where ‘his body was not his.’ The first freedom he will reclaim by breathing is the opening of his ribcage.",
    "ja": "窓に次の案件が投影される。"
